<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 6.19 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 6.19 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 6.19 percent on Thursday from 5.99 percent on Wednesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said five banks traded in 11 reported transactions worth 18.8 million dinars ($26.6 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
